  ('bullywug-guerreiro', 'Amphibious', 'The bullywug can breathe air and water.', 1),
  ('bullywug-guerreiro', 'Speak with Frogs and Toads', 'The bullywug can communicate simple concepts to frogs and toads when it speaks in Bullywug.', 2),
